  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "好一個人孔蓋！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D4E00500B4EBA5B5484CBFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "停停停！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "505C505C505CFF01FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對！停下來，\n看一下<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的腳邊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0DFF01505C4E0B4F86FF0C000A770B4E004E0B00100003110000FF01014F6059B376848173908AFF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市有著用寶可夢\n當設計圖案的人孔蓋。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E026709845775285BF653EF5922000A75768A2D8A085716684876844EBA5B5484CB300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是所謂的寶可夢人孔蓋。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F62408B0276845BF653EF59224EBA5B5484CB300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這就是其中的一個！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195C31662F51764E2D76844E00500BFF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "翡綠區是坐騎山羊的人孔蓋！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7FE17DA05340662F57509A0E5C717F8A76844EBA5B5484CBFF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來，這時候\n我就要問問<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F86FF0C901966425019000A62115C318981554F554F00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "榴紅區的人孔蓋\n是用什麼寶可夢設計的呢？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n把<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳覺得「就是牠！」的寶可夢\n給我看看吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "69B47D05534076844EBA5B5484CB000A662F75284EC09EBC5BF653EF59228A2D8A0876845462FF1F00100001BE01000A628A00100003110000FF01014F6059B389BA5F97300C5C31662F7260FF01300D76845BF653EF5922000A7D666211770B770B5427300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要給我看看在榴紅區作為\n人孔蓋設計圖案的寶可夢嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B389817D666211770B770B572869B47D0553404F5C70BA000A4EBA5B5484CB8A2D8A085716684876845BF653EF592255CEFF1F00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請看！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB770BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道答案，\n並且正好帶著那隻寶可夢時，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n再來告訴我一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B377E590537B546848FF0C000A4E264E146B63597D5E36845790A396BB5BF653EF59226642FF0C00100001BE00000A518D4F86544A8A3462114E0080725427300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請告訴我是哪隻寶可夢\n被當作人孔蓋的設計圖案。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB544A8A346211662F54EA96BB5BF653EF5922000A88AB75764F5C4EBA5B5484CB76848A2D8A0857166848300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果有<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳覺得是答案的寶可夢，\n就來給我看一看喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C670900100003110000FF01014F6059B389BA5F97662F7B54684876845BF653EF5922FF0C000A5C314F867D666211770B4E00770B5594FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可惜，不是牠呢……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF60DCFF0C4E0D662F726054622026202600100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雄性的火炎獅……\n幾乎是答對了，但不是牠～！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96C460277684706B708E734520262026000A5E7E4E4E662F7B545C0D4E86FF0C4F464E0D662F7260FF5EFF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雌性的火炎獅……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96CC60277684706B708E73452026202600100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叮咚叮咚叮咚～♪<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EE549A53EE549A53EE549AFF5E266A00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "漂亮地答對了～！厲害！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6F024EAE57307B545C0D4E86FF5EFF0153B25BB3FF01FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每個寶可夢人孔蓋都有各自的主題，\n榴紅區是「熱情」。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n雌性的火炎獅正適合這個主題對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF500B5BF653EF59224EBA5B5484CB90FD6709540481EA76844E3B984CFF0C000A69B47D055340662F300C71B160C5300D300200100001BE00000A96CC60277684706B708E73456B63906954089019500B4E3B984C5C0D5427300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "順便告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一下其他的人孔蓋主題。\n據說翡綠區是「友愛」，浦藍區是「謙虛」，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n蓉粉區是「優雅」，\n而瓊黃區是「活潑」喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98064FBF544A8A3400100003110000FF01014F6059B34E004E0B51764ED676844EBA5B5484CB4E3B984C3002000A64DA8AAA7FE17DA05340662F300C53CB611B300DFF0C6D6685CD5340662F300C8B19865B300DFF0C00100001BE01000A84C97C895340662F300C512A96C5300DFF0C000A800C74CA9EC35340662F300C6D3B6F51300D5594300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "偶爾在走路時注意一下人孔蓋，\n也是挺不錯的呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n當然，也要看好前方的路喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
